blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3141277203734434591/comments/default/2712154532150546367'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html?showComment=1378350992324#c2712154532150546367' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3141277203734434591' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3141277203734434591' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1672751706"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2013 at 9:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6311702042801325559</id><published>2013-09-04T11:53:12.224-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-04T11:53:12.224-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Keith, my point is that Pelosi is supposedly obses...</title><content type='html'>Keith, my point is that Pelosi is supposedly obsessing over horrible things in Syria, which is located just to the west of Iraq. I&amp;#39;m sorry I expressed myself so poorly. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3141277203734434591/comments/default/6311702042801325559'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3141277203734434591/comments/default/6311702042801325559'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html?showComment=1378317192224#c6311702042801325559' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='22' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Ol6GVktahVU/UhwPgHyhnNI/AAAAAAAAJeQ/ik4eBjgEKPs/s220/New%2BHeadshot.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3141277203734434591' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3141277203734434591' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2013 at 11:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1836621103111866339</id><published>2013-09-04T09:57:40.909-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-04T09:57:40.909-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Typo:&#xa;&amp;quot;At least for now, Syria seems to be th...</title><content type='html'>Typo:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;At least for now, Syria seems to be the geographic limit of Pelosi’s exquisite sensitivity regarding the suffering of children overseas.  Her concern crested just to the west of Iraq,&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;presumably it should read: &lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;just to the west of &lt;b&gt;Syria, in&lt;/b&gt; Iraq,&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3141277203734434591/comments/default/1836621103111866339'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3141277203734434591/comments/default/1836621103111866339'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html?showComment=1378310260909#c1836621103111866339' title=''/><author><name>Keith</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3141277203734434591' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3141277203734434591' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1591557066"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2013 at 9:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2948503329740560153</id><published>2013-09-03T16:41:43.291-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-03T16:41:43.291-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I wonder if, in the tradition of Orwell, Pelosi sa...</title><content type='html'>I wonder if, in the tradition of Orwell, Pelosi said to her grandson &amp;quot;All children are equal, but some children are more equal than others.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That would have made a better title, Will! </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3141277203734434591/comments/default/2948503329740560153'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3141277203734434591/comments/default/2948503329740560153'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html?showComment=1378248103291#c2948503329740560153' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/09/pelosi-willing-to-protect-syrian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3141277203734434591' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/328691